B.bxi=new A.c5(B.bAa,["Your name and company show on Home. Gender and joining date decide which leave types you get and how many days this year.","Where you work now, and where you worked before. Each job keeps its own hours, leave and rules.","Keep useful workplace sites together and open them in your browser.","Tell your office if you\u2019re eating, and see how many meals are ordered. Needs your work account.","Pick how ShiftLog looks. Every style works in light and dark mode.","Turn features on or off and choose your defaults, so the app fits how you work.","Your regular office hours. The time from start to end is your daily target \u2014 how long you need to work each day.","Many offices work shorter hours during Ramadan. Turn this on for the month and set those hours: your daily target and \u201cleave by\u201d time follow them. Turn it off after Eid to go back to your regular hours.","Your weekly days off. Weekend days don\u2019t count as working days, so they never lower your average.","Your office\u2019s work-from-home rules. Once a limit is reached, ShiftLog won\u2019t let you start a WFH day and tells you why.","Lock ShiftLog so only you can open it \u2014 with your fingerprint, face, phone screen lock or a PIN.","Notifications so you don\u2019t forget arrival or departure. Your phone may ask for permission the first time.","Sign in with Google and your data is backed up and kept in sync on every device automatically. Backup files are for keeping your own copy, or moving to a new phone without an account."],t.li)
